{"id": "section-body-13162", "title": "Contact Eczema (Dermatitis)", "chapterId": "chapter-thirteen", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "SKIN DISEASES", "Eczema (Dermatitis)", "Contact Eczema (Dermatitis)"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-13162", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Contact Eczema (Dermatitis)", "runs": [{"text": "Contact"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Eczema"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(Dermatitis)"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1368"}}, {"id": "body-13163", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Contact dermatitis is a common inflammatory skin condition characterized by erythematous and pruritic skin lesions that occur after contact with a foreign substance. There are two forms of contact dermatitis: irritant and allergic. Common allergens and irritants include nickel, rubber, fragrances (Perfumes), topical antibiotics, water, soaps, cleansers, acids and alkalis.", "runs": [{"text": "Contact"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dermatitis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "is"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "common"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "inflammatory"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "condition"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "characterized"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "by"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "erythematous"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "pruritic"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lesions"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "that"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "occur after contact with a foreign substance. There are two forms of contact dermatitis: irritant and allergic. Common allergens and irritants include nickel, rubber, fragrances (Perfumes), topical antibiotics, water, soaps, cleansers, acids and alkalis."}]}, {"id": "body-13165", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation:", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation:"}], "level": 4, "images": [{"src": "/data/images/image32.jpeg", "alt": "image32.jpeg"}]}, {"id": "body-13166", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Well-demarcated, erythematous, vesicular and/or scaly patch or plaque", "runs": [{"text": "Well-demarcated,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "erythematous,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vesicular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and/or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "scaly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patch or plaque"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13167", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Acute-blisters, weeping and oedema", "runs": [{"text": "Acute-blisters,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "weeping"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oedema"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13168", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Chronic-lichenification, hyperkeratosis and fissuring", "runs": [{"text": "Chronic-lichenification,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "hyperkeratosis"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "fissuring"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13169", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Itching or painful, may be severe", "runs": [{"text": "Itching"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "painful,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "may"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "severe"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13170", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The distribution can be linear or localized\tNickel allergy", "runs": [{"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "distribution"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "linear"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "localized"}, {"text": "\t"}, {"text": "Nickel", "italic": true}, {"text": " ", "italic": true}, {"text": "allergy", "italic": true}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13171", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Investigations:", "runs": [{"text": "Investigations:"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-13172", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Patch testing", "runs": [{"text": "Patch"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "testing"}]}, {"id": "body-13174", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-13175", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Avoid contact with the allergen or irritant", "runs": [{"text": "Avoid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "contact"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "allergen"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "irritant"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13176", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Using moisturizers multiple times per day", "runs": [{"text": "Using"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "moisturizers"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "multiple"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "times"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "per"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "day"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13177", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Avoid water, soap, oil, overheating, sweat, dust, and friction irritation, from doing further damage to the skin barrier", "runs": [{"text": "Avoid"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "water,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "soap,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "oil,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "overheating,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "sweat,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "dust,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "friction"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "irritation,"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "from"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "doing"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "further"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "damage"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "barrier"}], "list": {"level": 0, "numberingId": "1336"}}, {"id": "body-13179", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-13180", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "C: betamethasone valerate cream/ointment (topical) 12hourly for 4weeks", "runs": [{"text": "C:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "betamethasone"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "valerate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cream/ointment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(topical)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "12hourly"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "for"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "4weeks"}]}, {"id": "body-13181", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-13182", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "S: tacrolimus Ointment (face or skin folds) (topical) 12hourly", "runs": [{"text": "S:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "tacrolimus"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ointment"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(face"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "folds)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "(topical)"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "12hourly"}]}, {"id": "body-13183", "type": "paragraph", "style": "Heading3", "text": "OR", "runs": [{"text": "OR"}], "level": 3, "conjunction": true}, {"id": "body-13184", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "(For moderate cases)", "runs": [{"text": "(For"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "moderate"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "cases)"}]}, {"id": "body-13185", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "S: mometasone furoate cream/ointment (topical) 24hourly for 4weeks", "runs": [{"text": "S:", "bold": true}, {"text": " ", "bold": true}, {"text": "mom